This marker file documents that the repository is still in its initial
bootstrap state.

While this file exists, scripts/validate_change_log.py skips per-record
"coverage" validation against the merge base -- the initial import of the
authoritative files from Ames/OSU (and the four external files) is not expected
to carry a change-log row for every individual record.

Remove this file once ordinary, row-by-row edits begin. From that point on,
every added or modified authoritative record must have a matching entry in
metadata/database_changes.csv, enforced in CI against the pull request's merge
base.
